      "value": "So I saw the developer update where they show a prototype for this, and I have some feedback on that. For the sake of us who sell avatar bases, could we please make the selecting which is Quest and which is PC as part of the Pipeline Manager instead? It would way more useful if this metadata was saved in the scene rather than in the SDK window so that it can be saved and already be configured for a customer who opens the files.",
